        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポケモンに　もたせると\nピンチのとき　こうげきが\nきゅうしょに　あたりやすくなる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "포켓몬에게 지니게 하면\n위급할 때 공격이\n급소를 맞히기 쉬워진다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tenue, cette Baie augmente le taux de critiques\nen cas de besoin.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Als getragenes Item erhöht diese Beere die\nVolltrefferquote eines Pokémon, sobald es in\neiner Notlage steckt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si el Pokémon que la lleva lucha en un combate,\nduplica las ganancias.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Se il Pokémon che ha questa bacca si trova\nin difficoltà, la probabilità di sferrare brutti colpi\naumenta.",
