        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Berry to be consumed by Pokémon. If a Pokémon\nholds one, its critical-hit ratio will increase when it’s\nin a pinch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポケモンに　持たせると\nピンチのとき　攻撃が\n急所に　当たりやすくなる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "让宝可梦携带后，危机时，\n攻击会变得容易击中要害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si la lleva un Pokémon, aumenta la probabilidad de dar\nun golpe crítico en un momento de apuro.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
